      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGICAL SAIDE (8) goes very well at the distance with three wins and a placing from five starts. Scored by 4 lengths last time (17.38) in a Grade 3/4 over 324m at this track. Looks suited and should go close. TINO BANNER (2) boasts a strong record this journey here with eight wins and 13 minors from 23 tries. Placed last time (17.66) at this track in a NG, finishing third and beaten 5.5 lengths. Looks one of the chances. DESPICABLE RAMBO (7) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 17.56 beating Despicable Pedro. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Leading player again. KID KERMARO (5) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some good recent form but could only manage third (17.79) at this track. The form out of last race has been strong. Overdue and is among the main hopes.",
